# devenv-image-inspect

- CLI in `bin/devenv-image-inspect` owns podman/docker; editors only shell out.
- Keep command names: ImageInspect, ImageMeta, ImageHistory, ImageFs, ImageExport.
- Neovim module: `require("image-inspect")` + `setup()`.
- Do not commit secrets. Do not pull remote images implicitly.
- Packaging: VERSION + scripts/rpm-version.sh + COPR make_srpm pattern.
